      "html": "<h2>Already Applied? </h2>"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "b2adda55-c2f9-4c0f-9126-a10a1f11f7ac",
    "type": "CONTENT_NODE_TEXT",
    "content": {
      "html": "<p>Upon completion of the online application, participation in the program is dependent on completing the steps that have been explained to consider the student as a possible candidate.</p><p></p>"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "6a3a65b9-61e2-491f-a4b0-8f2e05c99d17",
    "type": "CONTENT_NODE_HEADING",
    "content": {
      "html": "<h2>¿Ya Aplicado?</h2>"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "5c427904-9ff2-4842-a4be-8d842d1a6b2c",
    "type": "CONTENT_NODE_TEXT",
    "content": {
      "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px\">Al completar la solicitud en línea, la participación en el programa depende de completar los pasos que se han explicado para considerar al estudiante como un posible candidato.</span></p><p></p>"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "fe09b0a6-423b-4a40-9e6f-d6c61ef6a138",
    "type": "CONTENT_NODE_HEADING",
    "content": {
      "html": "<h2>Have Questions?</h2>"
